Subject: [PATCH 24/25] hw/mchp: regenerated AVR64EA48 tables (SPI, TCB,
 CLKCTRL overlays)

New overlays for the AVR8X SPI (spi_8bit_v2) and TCB
(tmr_16b_capture_v1); CLKCTRL.MCLKSTATUS is read-only by field rather
than as a register, so MCC's init write of 0 is ignored as on silicon
instead of a guest error. Generated; do not edit.

Peripheral Pretender: AI-assisted, not for upstream QEMU.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
